{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415804","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415804","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041580401:1":{"text":"ほう……戦場を生き延びた者か、実に強靱な魂を持っているね。","source_cn":"啊，一位战场幸存者，有着无比坚韧的灵魂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA351AA0FF114793C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580402:1":{"text":"バンティスのグレイヴボーンか……！","source_cn":"班题斯的亡灵……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8190C5F31A9E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580403:1":{"text":"ははっ、バンティスの戦闘狂たちを知っているのか。","source_cn":"呵呵，看来你认识那群战争狂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA568188772156EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580404:1":{"text":"安心してくれ。私は彼らとは違う。彼らに私の半分でも理性があれば、私だって何度も引っ越さずに済んだんだけどね。","source_cn":"放心，我和他们不同。但凡他们有我一半的理智，我也不至于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1A9FC3CA25D715","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580405:1":{"text":"武器を下ろしてくれ。生者と争うつもりはない。","source_cn":"我无意与生者争斗，你可以放下武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x895FEBE0A7EEB2FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580406:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーンに命令される筋合いはない。","source_cn":"你无权命令我，亡灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA4E23D9480382A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580407:1":{"text":"ははっ、その口ぶりを見るに、君はバンティスと戦ったことがある元軍人だね。","source_cn":"真是令人怀念的语气。你一定在军队待过，而且曾经和班题斯交手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA0C082479B6D10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580408:1":{"text":"立ち姿、歩き方、視線、それに染みついた警戒心……君は相当優秀だったのだろう。","source_cn":"站姿、步态、眼神，还有下意识的警惕……你还是最出色的那类。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1969BF25D97CC023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580409:1":{"text":"……お前も軍人だったのか？","source_cn":"……你也是军人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38DA8A2832B8E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580410:1":{"text":"そんなところだ。私は生前軍医で、君のような人を大勢救ったよ。もちろん、後悔も数え切れないほどある。","source_cn":"姑且算是吧。我生前是个军医，救过很多像你这样的人。当然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5E3E90FBF2639FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580411:1":{"text":"……戦場ではそれが普通だ。だがその言い方だと、まだ吹っ切れてはいない