4":"0xF16D383FB127794B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041580417:1":{"text":"その友人が心配なら、君がグレイヴボーンになって、いつまでも傍にいてやったほうがいいのではないかな？もちろん、今すぐにとは言わないが……","source_cn":"不过，如果你真的放不下他，变成亡灵和他永远作伴难道不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x111CEC7FB0D60534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041580418:1":{"text":"……言ったはずだ、私は、決してグレイヴボーンにはならない。","source_cn":"……我说过，我绝不会变成亡灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69DB7FB8A4FB9573","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041580419:1":{"text":"あの時……ほかに選択があったなら……私だって、あいつをグレイヴボーンには……","source_cn":"如果不是当时情况紧急，如果不是没有选择……我也不想他变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15297C4C88DC50AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041580420:1":{"text":"けれど、起きてしまったことは誰にも変えられない。違うかい？","source_cn":"但事情已经发生，谁都无力改变，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DECA560B4C0BE59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041580421:1":{"text":"私に言わせれば、グレイヴボーンになったとしても、家族といつまでも一緒にいられるなら、それも一つの幸せだと思うよ。","source_cn":"如果要我来说，与家人永远相伴——哪怕是以亡灵的身份——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36E27C52C4ABB5A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041580422:1":{"text":"……提案には感謝するが、やはり、私はグレイヴボーンにはならない。","source_cn":"……感谢你的劝告，但我更希望我用不上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC00092F0DBA89F9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041580423:1":{"text":"自我を保てるのなら、そうなることも利はあるのだろう。だが私が知る奴らの多くは、誰かの道具にされ、悪事に使われていた。","source_cn":"如果能维持自我，变成亡灵或许有好处。可惜的是，我见过的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2E65B73B2DC5C50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041580424:1":{"text":"友人がそんなふうになるとは思っていない。だが、私自身がそうならない保証はない。僅かな可能性でも、私はそれを避けたいのだ。","source_cn":"我相信我的朋友不会变成那副模样，但我也不希望我有变成那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ACFB6CD4040D249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:尼汝":{"text":"ニル","source":"尼汝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟恩":{"text":"セイン","source":"瑟恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":2}}